{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md","title":"K and Gödel Set Equivalent","display":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent","aliases":["92-thm-k-g-equivalent"],"display":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent","depends_on":["[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-df-godel-set]]","[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-k-g-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (Gödel set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic adequacy for representing computations)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\equiv_m K_G\">\\(K \\equiv_m K_G\\)</span> : 停机集与Gödel集多一等价</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\leq_m K_G\">\\(K \\leq_m K_G\\)</span>：停机问题可归约到可证性问题</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G \\leq_m K\">\\(K_G \\leq_m K\\)</span>：可证性问题可归约到停机问题</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>系统G可以模拟程序执行（算术化）</li>\n<li>对相容、有效且包含足够算术的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，程序停机可统一编码为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中的可证性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>正是原断言遗漏的强度前提</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>不相容，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>退化为全部句子码，原来的无条件等价结论失败</li>\n<li>这建立了不完备性与停机问题的联系</li>\n<li>两者通过完备归约紧密相连，但不完备性定理并非Rice定理或停机不可判定性的字面“同一个定理”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ (halting set, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_G$ (Gödel set, see [[92-df-godel-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"K \\equiv_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K \\leq_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G \\leq_m K","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9b07b1eae12ec61","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-adda